WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Luke, I am your father.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.240
That's not how he sounds. He's not Batman.

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:04.803
Jesus.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.700
Luke...

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.820
Oh that is way better.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:08.159
I am your father.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:21.920
Oh you have not known how long I've been wanting to taste the blue milk

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.780
That's how they drink in the damn universe.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.540
Ooh! That's Yoda. Done.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.520
I like the lightsabers.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.180
(Lightsaber sounds)

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.520
Oh no, it broke my --

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.500
I won!

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.100
Cheers, I have blue milk.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:36.160
It doesn't take like anything.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.584
It looks like Lucky Charms, but it tastes like Fruit Loops.

00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:39.904
Which is tripping me out.

00:00:39.904 --> 00:00:40.484
Oh God!

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.380
There's like so much sugar in this. It's amazing.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:48.460
Jedi Gels!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.860
I feel like this is what Jedis have to eat so they stay energized during battle.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.209
Let's give it a shot...

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.600
Oh my God. Wow.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.060
Oh man. That's delightful. I love it.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:00:59.820
Mmmmm. No?

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.400
Jedis seem pretty fit.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.020
Like Obi-Wan seemed like a stud back in the day in Episode One and I don't think he was eating these.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.100
If you were a kid in the lunch room,

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.800
"I'll give you C-3PO for R2D2."

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.900
"I'll trade you my Yoda for it."

00:01:11.615 --> 00:01:13.455
I got a bunch. You want C-3PO?

00:01:13.455 --> 00:01:14.321
Yeah, I'll take a C-3PO.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.540
I'll eat your Yoda.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:16.220
Nice.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.080
Is this a lightsaber?

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:25.680
Yes!!

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.200
Not as satisfying as in the series, but..

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:32.760
Oh sh**!

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.740
(Lightsabers humming)

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.100
Oh my God, I just got a huge nerd boner. It was great.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.840
I wonder if this is what the Jedis go through when they get their new lightsabers

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.600
and go through a shit ton of plastic.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.020
Now we gotta assemble it.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.160
No, this is not good. No it isn't.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.760
After all that work it should taste like something. Right?

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.000
What's your flavor?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.660
I feel like my flavor is just sugar.

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:59.520
I feel like it would taste better if it had a little bit of a sourness

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.560
but this is just straight up sweet.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.500
You know what? I think I'm done.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:05.980
This is not for eating. This is for play only.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.620
Oh my God, I'm so happy!

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:20.060
I need this in my life.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.920
I could almost cry right now.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:24.900
Oh my gosh. He's wearing the full Groucho Marx..

00:02:24.962 --> 00:02:26.502
To avoid copyright issues.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:28.240
Oh my God.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.200
It's already my new favorite beer. I don't even have to try it.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.260
It smells delicious and let's just say that.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:34.240
Alright. Cheers.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.940
That is so good. I dig.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.100
I love it.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.720
It kinda tastes like coffee.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.440
Mm-hmm!

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:41.600
Yep. Yeah.

00:02:41.749 --> 00:02:43.929
It had a bit of a bite at first, which confused me

00:02:43.929 --> 00:02:45.469
but then once I got into it, it was great.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.640
I just picture me on the canteen on Tatooine

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.102
and I just order one of these bad boys.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.560
Just getting turnt with some intergalactic buzz.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:55.100
Chewbacca would drink this.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.840
Mm-hmm. I see that.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:58.475
I bet Chewbacca's a drunk.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.180
That's why he can't talk. Right?

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.501
He's just wasted all the time.

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:05.461
He actually speaks English, but it just comes out..     Can you do an impression?

00:03:05.461 --> 00:03:06.821
(Chewbacca roar)

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:10.554
It's like you need to get your vocal chords to flap together

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:11.460
(Chewbacca impression)

